        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_CONDOTTIERO_BASE_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Tuscan unique Exploration Age infantry line. Replaces the Swordsman, the Man-at-Arms and the Pikeman. Stronger than the units it replaces, and stronger again when attacking.</Text>
        </Row>
