        <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_GALEA_SANTO_STEFANO_NAME">
            <Text>Galea di Santo Stefano</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_GALEA_SANTO_STEFANO_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>Tuscan unique Exploration Age naval unit. Replaces the Cog. Faster, sees further, and hits harder against other ships.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_GALEA_SANTO_STEFANO_DESCRIPTION">
            <Text>+5 [icon:COMBAT] Combat Strength against Naval units.</Text>
        </Row>
        <Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_GALEA_SANTO_STEFANO_PREVIEW">
            <Text>Rotta per l'Occidente: +5 Combat Strength against Naval units.</Text>
        </Row>
